  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "十月十二日，我收到电报：“涤洲病危”。",
      "output_sha256": "2b1808a1e1bcfb667ecf1bfe8c7e0c5a44c952f3149bce9088f4c0dc5945adff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.757198,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b6aa78936080035b531f580e01667ba73ac1b86b9cbace9fd2ec3e202e218810"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2b1808a1e1bcfb667ecf1bfe8c7e0c5a44c952f3149bce9088f4c0dc5945adff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "十四起身；到北平，他已过去。",
      "output_sha256": "e1fe88a63e776d4545637cc5380008f505b200fa5f83d401dd7149d5bf9ae011",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "e1fe88a63e776d4545637cc5380008f505b200fa5f83d401dd7149d5bf9ae011",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "接到电报后，我拖延了一天才出发，希望在这段时间内能收到好消息。",
      "output_sha256": "c9300c9f5fc3028c352187671f5369a2f9e9fe73633e04dc34a3b7f1309201f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.516307,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7f28c568800a21b7abb5180b5511da097876c960e2146ca6d0d36bb813c7f9f9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c9300c9f5fc3028c352187671f5369a2f9e9fe73633e04dc34a3b7f1309201f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "十二号以前，什么信儿都没听到，怎能忽然“病危”？",
      "output_sha256": "84de2a5073f502d01cdb5b9f380850cb74eecb141c5375d0cb66edd9b444009c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "84de2a5073f502d01cdb5b9f380850cb74eecb141c5375d0cb66edd9b444009c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "涤洲的身体好，大家都晓得，所以我不信那个电报，而且深信必再有电更正。",
      "output_sha256": "be0279f079e46a7867748424fd07fa99ad341eb744834c0de8f7e07e86eb0f85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "be0279f079e46a7867748424fd07fa99ad341eb744834c0de8f7e07e86eb0f85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "等了一天，白等；我的心凉了。",
      "output_sha256": "56acc313430f54e919556803a4ca665c98e7fdbed02074bef25c90212bf9239e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "56acc313430f54e919556803a4ca665c98e7fdbed02074bef25c90212bf9239e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在火车上，泪水始终在我的眼中打转。",
      "output_sha256": "56ccb883f9c44583bcbd958a0d6312ebc0fbd3e4793075753a8a10f6ab7c95dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.609762,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2f32f9b3855d33f20b1cf926242172bddfea9d450376b708e523ca6ff7a04458"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "56ccb883f9c44583bcbd958a0d6312ebc0fbd3e4793075753a8a10f6ab7c95dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "到达前门时，迎接我的是齐铁恨——他在南京工作——我们的眼泪都流了下来。",
      "output_sha256": "63da2f3e4e44761fd79f26ec5cea6c0b75813702ebb9f1a3a78cf30aa7a11476",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.672003,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f52d8708a47ee48f85a4681b868d95d21e9b3c16a1e63697839555651fc11bc2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "63da2f3e4e44761fd79f26ec5cea6c0b75813702ebb9f1a3a78cf30aa7a11476",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我恨自己晚来了一天，但铁恨比我早来一天，却也没见到涤洲。",
      "output_sha256": "8064f17e0e941696789c008a46aee7562952bc31bdea360412a0cf6b1c9d7300",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.63206,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1ee6763fe5cae1fd4dac90d1b8ad9548bddfba9804411a6df8f646fbbab1ae52"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8064f17e0e941696789c008a46aee7562952bc31bdea360412a0cf6b1c9d7300",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "十二的早晨，“他”就走了。",
      "output_sha256": "ac82ac08426ee498d5cfadc1a81086b116d08feb67299d8fa185cec2b038b3b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "ac82ac08426ee498d5cfadc1a81086b116d08feb67299d8fa185cec2b038b3b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这完全像个梦。",
      "output_sha256": "8b7c6690bc8633e7511c10aaa535166ad7210186d9eb0bf4ff0253fdc064240e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "8b7c6690bc8633e7511c10aaa535166ad7210186d9eb0bf4ff0253fdc064240e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "八月底，我们三个——涤洲，铁恨，与我——还在南京会着。",
      "output_sha256": "246a7e4f9eadb9f0ce7ba74b94412185a249609425a9ff8e6227127788947a06",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "246a7e4f9eadb9f0ce7ba74b94412185a249609425a9ff8e6227127788947a06",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "多么欢喜呀！",
      "output_sha256": "73af79218d9bb996442d8330faaa1b894af1416155dce3bb417fef1816b1f121",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "73af79218d9bb996442d8330faaa1b894af1416155dce3bb417fef1816b1f121",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "涤洲张罗着逛这儿那儿，还要陪我到上海，都被我拦住了。",
      "output_sha256": "6a0f7ba78a0eb9f20bb508e82524301811bef8345879c43cd75c2599e7847466",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "6a0f7ba78a0eb9f20bb508e82524301811bef8345879c43cd75c2599e7847466",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他先是跟刘半农先生去西北，半农去世后，他又去了西安讲学。",
      "output_sha256": "96ba382d717e23b21ca2ef475bdbff7f2949b472c8c28b3af87c20befc713e9c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.620499,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "12e34c8938d64603c9d4219b7997cd763834edfd4dd74af5a1696a0e6c248d2c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "96ba382d717e23b21ca2ef475bdbff7f2949b472c8c28b3af87c20befc713e9c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "由西安跑到南京，还要随我上上海。",
      "output_sha256": "94cad914126a1ade1397f8e7751cc809f5e4ff757dd7689ffe6757aad8c04c4d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "94cad914126a1ade1397f8e7751cc809f5e4ff757dd7689ffe6757aad8c04c4d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我没叫他去。",
      "output_sha256": "2bb440200bd6c4d13d1c14cd909423679f5b8291dd1b9e7478d308d5eb034352",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "2bb440200bd6c4d13d1c14cd909423679f5b8291dd1b9e7478d308d5eb034352",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他的身体确是好，但是那么热的天，四下里跑，不是玩的。",
      "output_sha256": "634a6daa92fe384ca3d12d91a773c2ed2d730175b57c8d4e8da74796bf6e1232",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "634a6daa92fe384ca3d12d91a773c2ed2d730175b57c8d4e8da74796bf6e1232",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这只是我的小心；梦也梦不到他会死。",
      "output_sha256": "615611f37b9f8f22dcf1a248a208d4d1b716d73c4f0f04ef54e3535740a1c283",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "615611f37b9f8f22dcf1a248a208d4d1b716d73c4f0f04ef54e3535740a1c283",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他回到北平后，给我写信说自己搬了家，此后再也没有音信。",
      "output_sha256": "58e0c2484333e9adbf3c2bcadd0656daab51abd8952f749b0ccd12ac4b69df3c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.438646,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cb007aabf60c46d087aa10d9b46dca6128ae15250714095be666c97cc57183c5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "58e0c2484333e9adbf3c2bcadd0656daab51abd8952f749b0ccd12ac4b69df3c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "以后，再没信了，我心里还说：他大概是忙着作文章呢。",
      "output_sha256": "b3928f09bc7081998ce3874fba01711d689483a4b017d5f2fbb15f9212c9fb55",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "b3928f09bc7081998ce3874fba01711d689483a4b017d5f2fbb15f9212c9fb55",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "敢情他又到河南讲学去了。",
      "output_sha256": "63886488d049cbe0f3849d9d14dc90ffcb4c73d4cae2deb36df183122c9e96b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "63886488d049cbe0f3849d9d14dc90ffcb4c73d4cae2deb36df183122c9e96b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "由河南回来就病。",
      "output_sha256": "6dd2c4df0124be7cfc48b5ee833ac19f71f9a0ab8f694f4fdb4cdbcdc3656788",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "6dd2c4df0124be7cfc48b5ee833ac19f71f9a0ab8f694f4fdb4cdbcdc3656788",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "十二号我接到那个电报。",
      "output_sha256": "a84ca8f5da09d66e95e9f4b4800765f691c1a884a187861cb2a7ceacbd04028f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "a84ca8f5da09d66e95e9f4b4800765f691c1a884a187861cb2a7ceacbd04028f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这不像个梦？",
      "output_sha256": "c646950895d12456bf0123ba48b80312d34c8cde42bec8f1786c30263e009e67",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "c646950895d12456bf0123ba48b80312d34c8cde42bec8f1786c30263e009e67",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "今天翻阅旧稿时，我发现夹着他去年一月十日在西山写给我的一封信。",
      "output_sha256": "c98aa72dbf6d837d5a4639860f746c940403f3bf144e0330f35f77b42ff8a363",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.623731,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "394539d267916a8008e84428ae3db1333dad46724ce039b5e72976c800333f30"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c98aa72dbf6d837d5a4639860f746c940403f3bf144e0330f35f77b42ff8a363",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“苓儿死去……咽气恰与伊母下葬同时，使我不能不特别哀痛。",
      "output_sha256": "d6a7f8a2d7e2b3c089bdb67d6a90d428f387e512e47216bec2207c89b3dbae6a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "d6a7f8a2d7e2b3c089bdb67d6a90d428f387e512e47216bec2207c89b3dbae6a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在家里，我抱着大庄，母亲抱着菊，四代同堂，情形极为惨烈。",
      "output_sha256": "d20f32bb3923be37c12071e4f2a12107ec669af6818e7068f99742a5f8911700",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.577271,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "33b1d258d6859a4403d364f4224b60730ce7a5083426833c0d0ec4173f98937a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d20f32bb3923be37c12071e4f2a12107ec669af6818e7068f99742a5f8911700",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "现在我来到西山，住在第三小学的最底层，偌大的地方只有我一个人。",
      "output_sha256": "b8a1b64f5060d0700e4b40daf2eaaecdb265b7d9cd3a6ab095214e98ae440e85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.781119,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8893f8d9fd95de97aecf32ca38e21f8b27c4c259cbcb754c358e4d83297bc01c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b8a1b64f5060d0700e4b40daf2eaaecdb265b7d9cd3a6ab095214e98ae440e85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "天极冷，风顶大，冰寒的月光布满了庭院，我隔着玻窗，凝望南山，回忆两礼拜来的遭遇，止不住的眼泪流下来！”",
      "output_sha256": "6af449c60b5b715e189d057d9c9f3b6377ceb04593f0fb530fa66eba17c25145",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "6af449c60b5b715e189d057d9c9f3b6377ceb04593f0fb530fa66eba17c25145",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“两礼拜来的遭遇”是大孩子蓝死，夫人死，女孩苓死。",
      "output_sha256": "7ebd1d7fd955ad5d9d85dab0050a5fde09e230f2bf3420e79a5aa1b65f06e6d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "7ebd1d7fd955ad5d9d85dab0050a5fde09e230f2bf3420e79a5aa1b65f06e6d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "跟着——老天欺侮起来好人没完！",
      "output_sha256": "8b05a4ce947efaed4ca33632810bcb67ee13ebaa7bb4fa4b6a7b5659336b3591",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "8b05a4ce947efaed4ca33632810bcb67ee13ebaa7bb4fa4b6a7b5659336b3591",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "——是菊死，和白老伯死；一气去了五口。",
      "output_sha256": "7c4054254c31aa9089330c1ee9793da9bf353e46e9dd2234fc8df159b90bd6ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c4054254c31aa9089330c1ee9793da9bf353e46e9dd2234fc8df159b90bd6ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "蓝是在夜间去世的，他一边哭着一边写信给我。",
      "output_sha256": "b7e8ccf3033b4af830b14c94e6dea45ed142415e0ac1fae2265d0c876c1c91b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.632055,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bdebdd65005cb3ef54951a5e9fc59d1380b2d9784e44e1d4f69471c1c3ad35b2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b7e8ccf3033b4af830b14c94e6dea45ed142415e0ac1fae2265d0c876c1c91b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "紧跟着又得到白夫人病故的信，我跑回北平去安慰他。",
      "output_sha256": "f2e2ba3e153b036f7b7cfe7ca6863611f35ce5ab82f5c02cdc446944a3fa6522",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "f2e2ba3e153b036f7b7cfe7ca6863611f35ce5ab82f5c02cdc446944a3fa6522",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他还支持着，始终不放声的哭，可是端茶碗的时候手颤。",
      "output_sha256": "97311bf798e5edfbdfd8deaf4a48b3d668dec2fba1cb570164ae0ce1fd68ddc6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "97311bf798e5edfbdfd8deaf4a48b3d668dec2fba1cb570164ae0ce1fd68ddc6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "接下来又去世了三口，大家对他的担忧愈发加重。",
      "output_sha256": "e36c9660812bfad3bc85b22107a30edb3d18c4db4ebfbfec7083738df25ff125",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.378052,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "085d6aa4a406d542467968e106f5ebb591bd55c744bcfa1e23e4e65ef133057c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e36c9660812bfad3bc85b22107a30edb3d18c4db4ebfbfec7083738df25ff125",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他失眠，闭上眼睛就看到他的孩子。",
      "output_sha256": "39c3954d83a2bd70e6d0db617b98d276a9dfa49d9a3f44343c485b9224f1de6b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.779464,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5ad4a2f4cc99d2932b94af65a39586908c8a5340431733483f7fc16bb63a58be"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "39c3954d83a2bd70e6d0db617b98d276a9dfa49d9a3f44343c485b9224f1de6b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是他不喝酒，不吸烟，像棵松树似的立着。",
      "output_sha256": "20bb5ecf86958e77eb2e8798be0d2fd50860d0f8bd4c75881cf514e04d2319ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "20bb5ecf86958e77eb2e8798be0d2fd50860d0f8bd4c75881cf514e04d2319ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他要作好到底。",
      "output_sha256": "3c5f606c2a4688aecb8e2a6484f98c2e7a73baa970621bd24fd0cee39b52638e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "3c5f606c2a4688aecb8e2a6484f98c2e7a73baa970621bd24fd0cee39b52638e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如今，他的老母亲六十多岁，续娶的妻子二十多岁，以及五岁的大庄！",
      "output_sha256": "35b5b07232d060ca46fb973c96bcbd8084cd85f59fc830b4f81141651e918daa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.509544,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cd813d0a3e4808d9b2a18b4b534fce27e2be7d025b7422f26cd6b7974807eb2c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "35b5b07232d060ca46fb973c96bcbd8084cd85f59fc830b4f81141651e918daa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "人生到底是什么？",
      "output_sha256": "4d5865094e6f83d2c605a9880bbfb56eead87f58e561e6d498c66883e35ac1ce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.655082,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1a92e46dc5de6519cef060b032b081682dfcb36ddb8844fda49ff8d1e89c56e0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4d5865094e6f83d2c605a9880bbfb56eead87f58e561e6d498c66883e35ac1ce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "朋友里，他最好。",
      "output_sha256": "4202860012761c4ce194a8e6fb6407071cba2ef38336b24d9aedd6bc8d9405a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "4202860012761c4ce194a8e6fb6407071cba2ef38336b24d9aedd6bc8d9405a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他对谁也好。",
      "output_sha256": "f9b69ce0ba0c3d33ebddfab26684748c29bf54d6f08e51f275dfe74e1c0068af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "f9b69ce0ba0c3d33ebddfab26684748c29bf54d6f08e51f275dfe74e1c0068af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有他，大家的交情有了中心。",
      "output_sha256": "e115d8de1377c88e20f58c82d54f35adc86881141780865fac5112e46785a53f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "e115d8de1377c88e20f58c82d54f35adc86881141780865fac5112e46785a53f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他总是积极主动、任劳任怨，能够做事、愿意做事，精力充沛。",
      "output_sha256": "fd054115ce4bd8fe306e61184b4b37706cedbb17eace3652831c888f3172ddc5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.348819,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "53d0f85336517e5a2b588cb8c3eb055583184a5077cbb7bad959df43e7086512"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fd054115ce4bd8fe306e61184b4b37706cedbb17eace3652831c888f3172ddc5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "对家人，对朋友，永远舍己从人。",
      "output_sha256": "702741f86136bb27b89c4375872781fab63d8ad16be6e78606ef43379c10ecb2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "702741f86136bb27b89c4375872781fab63d8ad16be6e78606ef43379c10ecb2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "即便明知会受骗，他仍然愿意去做，只求自己心安。",
      "output_sha256": "934d5c5aded5da1db9515f75342ee83aabcaff5813aac14af2a66565eb36c8df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.334803,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0680f48f05354110860dc94312f93bac5d38976ee887442798a5c9637ca5ef81"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "934d5c5aded5da1db9515f75342ee83aabcaff5813aac14af2a66565eb36c8df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他很精明，但不掏出手段；他很会办事，多一半是因为肯办，肯认真办。",
      "output_sha256": "2f74fbf9119b7012f4a938d621b8bfc59497b63ff1adc445086632d5e923297f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "2f74fbf9119b7012f4a938d621b8bfc59497b63ff1adc445086632d5e923297f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他就这么累死了。",
      "output_sha256": "7e64b9bbcd26f44fbdba37dd9e790474cc65beded4c6199e422c153cfc3ef06d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "7e64b9bbcd26f44fbdba37dd9e790474cc65beded4c6199e422c153cfc3ef06d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "对学问，他很谦虚，总说他自己“低能”。",
      "output_sha256": "728ab01d924730f0954a91a3b88ad05b767914e9282c3cbf7514561369720115",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "728ab01d924730f0954a91a3b88ad05b767914e9282c3cbf7514561369720115",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而在如此忙碌的日子里，他在音韵学方面却取得了成就，出版了著作。",
      "output_sha256": "eabeda43798f1e904c10cfc58287ad53d6fc5856834495601420dad0e051b4d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.431924,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9f915c140be39a956096e42508f9182b5993e03b134d86fcee4c37cdf4ee572f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eabeda43798f1e904c10cfc58287ad53d6fc5856834495601420dad0e051b4d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在家中失去五口亲人后，他依然去西北调查方音！",
      "output_sha256": "37d54d80115a6f56cb938a86bca0fc86ed602d9cb916223c8659e1e93e882da2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.42411,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d9be39c2cd8b54ba55ab042f0807e0ca164e5c42e2a240c2bfdb97a629defd4d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "37d54d80115a6f56cb938a86bca0fc86ed602d9cb916223c8659e1e93e882da2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他还笑着说呢：到外边散散心。",
      "output_sha256": "0993c5183a978f5d2bd7c92e129be24c0608f15ed8bca3666ecb0d720d25a92d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "0993c5183a978f5d2bd7c92e129be24c0608f15ed8bca3666ecb0d720d25a92d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "死了五口，散心？",
      "output_sha256": "c62ad69d9c2e5586af8512b01a38ff09cc8fba934f8b7b56dce6c62f09e2c370",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "c62ad69d9c2e5586af8512b01a38ff09cc8fba934f8b7b56dce6c62f09e2c370",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他并不是心狠，而是尽力去锻造自己。",
      "output_sha256": "d34dae2231adbe8b500c53b164abac8a28e9b5897738bc4bfb33456086522e68",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.475961,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "715c59e26406827e999e82dd89e9bf6dfc897b15d719646e86211c8840af7db1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d34dae2231adbe8b500c53b164abac8a28e9b5897738bc4bfb33456086522e68",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他老要对得起自己，对得起朋友，对得起一生。",
      "output_sha256": "b5f412f701ffd9f361f9e625c15552a926476626cc379b02316331a90e434bde",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "b5f412f701ffd9f361f9e625c15552a926476626cc379b02316331a90e434bde",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "卅五岁就死去，这样的人，只有无知的老天知道怎回事！",
      "output_sha256": "a3305d60c820ade5220f2ffa823aa86bbc03da51bd7e410566c7dfbd1982e73c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "a3305d60c820ade5220f2ffa823aa86bbc03da51bd7e410566c7dfbd1982e73c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自我一认识他，他仿佛就是个高个子。",
      "output_sha256": "2e0b0e5d00a1ec31d1be681680957024d4be83c45fb53bf4976fbb93065c4ffa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "2e0b0e5d00a1ec31d1be681680957024d4be83c45fb53bf4976fbb93065c4ffa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "老推平头，老穿深色的衣服，腮上胡子很重。",
      "output_sha256": "2b376b7588be32b0db5dfb2e2c71ed65f4b4646ac98aeb0691721c2a77f4d945",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "2b376b7588be32b0db5dfb2e2c71ed65f4b4646ac98aeb0691721c2a77f4d945",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "偶尔穿上西装，他还会嘲笑自己不漂亮。",
      "output_sha256": "9fb96c20c27b487dd52e510d27f44e3636b96a188160218c30467957eaabf5c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.598302,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61,
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f62909b6e1134f9b10f02ba999bdfd4b7f54e72f0090c7d3d7a852ba035ece7c",
        "5d79a47adc0c72ec2bc4776a22a3f941d2856b26dcde713665a4cb2369663159"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9fb96c20c27b487dd52e510d27f44e3636b96a188160218c30467957eaabf5c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他知道自己的缺点。",
      "output_sha256": "9028b68b5cdc77e0d5caf539bd5c6337bf9e7403bd038ddc0b89e8cb6cb8c4ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.668333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0d48a1b3238bfe1cd575e1865aee3e63b8ceb1b52d2feb7a9a45902375abc2f8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9028b68b5cdc77e0d5caf539bd5c6337bf9e7403bd038ddc0b89e8cb6cb8c4ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有一次，他把件绸子大衫染得发了绿头，他笑着把它藏起去：“这不行，这不行，穿它还能上街？”",
      "output_sha256": "64e0fa7513a04291cf00c17cc18b8246f8e038213223544afa82b36cae124126",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "64e0fa7513a04291cf00c17cc18b8246f8e038213223544afa82b36cae124126",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他感觉自己没有什么能耐。",
      "output_sha256": "4bfe5569ec8691330c2eacad34dfd6d2a1d11b6b41c81d8c51211e6c7f75b822",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.341283,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        65
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a9e7d2ac11cb725e5eedc3ec04e2a7d9c95b98b8f3a6dc3e40b0e392e0c3435e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4bfe5569ec8691330c2eacad34dfd6d2a1d11b6b41c81d8c51211e6c7f75b822",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "于是高过他的人，他不巴结。",
      "output_sha256": "d4055c3c5577dc305e08bfacf4b7ca44d3b303eb6e8f5e704baaeae906dd9c28",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4055c3c5577dc305e08bfacf4b7ca44d3b303eb6e8f5e704baaeae906dd9c28",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "低于他的人，他帮忙。",
      "output_sha256": "5011146972e18c4352d9da3d185804a9691a0039e3162ca1b74f4979db563f85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_human_sha256": "5011146972e18c4352d9da3d185804a9691a0039e3162ca1b74f4979db563f85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "对他自己，在幽默的轻视中去努力。",
      "output_sha256": "c5fad65d897c9d6c562bae5a3dfcbec78a1793863005294557280f888eb66593",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_human_sha256": "c5fad65d897c9d6c562bae5a3dfcbec78a1793863005294557280f888eb66593",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "高高的个子，灰色或蓝色的长袍，一天到晚他奔忙。",
      "output_sha256": "5cb650c297eea5a5de3ab02f0a7d8ddaa1ea8591d4b07d27172aa144e989b3b6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 69,
      "source_human_sha256": "5cb650c297eea5a5de3ab02f0a7d8ddaa1ea8591d4b07d27172aa144e989b3b6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他并没有超人的思想，只求在自己能力所及的领域，学问和为人上去努力。",
      "output_sha256": "4f823f742246eeaf7027e66fcf63136cab550800840706927e4ce01b767d1bcb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": 0.597857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        70
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "86c1b1ca9c05523ccceb44c9955f478cb76657a5855430570a8769016be09e8f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4f823f742246eeaf7027e66fcf63136cab550800840706927e4ce01b767d1bcb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他实在。",
      "output_sha256": "e8d0517dbe72204a684b9dfc38d8ffb78d31e6d0602bf6d2768b552407107235",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_human_sha256": "e8d0517dbe72204a684b9dfc38d8ffb78d31e6d0602bf6d2768b552407107235",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说给他一件新事，或一个新的思想，他要想了，然后他拍着腿：“高！",
      "output_sha256": "cdff8ec52658d1e8a94362f2cd4421f1dcac5d6344f34e02010b394cdef1e0fa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "cdff8ec52658d1e8a94362f2cd4421f1dcac5d6344f34e02010b394cdef1e0fa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "高！”",
      "output_sha256": "a77d8e1497f6d9f08ca419a83abaae23382865a0c1ce4ab4df69b3311993bcbd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_human_sha256": "a77d8e1497f6d9f08ca419a83abaae23382865a0c1ce4ab4df69b3311993bcbd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 73,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "到此为止；他能了解，而永远不能作出来，新的。",
      "output_sha256": "1558e391661be33a35c29e9fb274dc938958e25a09579a3413d4845fcfa86aa2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_human_sha256": "1558e391661be33a35c29e9fb274dc938958e25a09579a3413d4845fcfa86aa2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 74,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "旧社会的享受，他没享受过；新的，也没享受过。",
      "output_sha256": "5f57acc9de99a98781aa58ec91c2c1832736d200a87c83c7b6ae2eb64f014a90",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 75,
      "source_human_sha256": "5f57acc9de99a98781aa58ec91c2c1832736d200a87c83c7b6ae2eb64f014a90",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 75,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他老想使别人过得去，什么新的旧的，反正自己没占了便宜。",
      "output_sha256": "34a1bad38609bfd7553cb11e8a90ce0bd5c31081a1a818db07f14e123f0f3f8d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 76,
      "source_human_sha256": "34a1bad38609bfd7553cb11e8a90ce0bd5c31081a1a818db07f14e123f0f3f8d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 76,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自己不占便宜就舒服。",
      "output_sha256": "66863d3f85a3cd07bb660ffd9e19bd0f6b75b5c2c25b36fd9568cff9d9e3cb1f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 77,
      "source_human_sha256": "66863d3f85a3cd07bb660ffd9e19bd0f6b75b5c2c25b36fd9568cff9d9e3cb1f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 77,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "就是在失去五口亲人的情况下，他依然能够站稳脚跟，替朋友办事、努力工作，这正是他内心强大的结果。",
      "output_sha256": "19fd00e2783148d4a5693bf06e1d9ed1a2ce9f3099373e16deb195f721bf2711",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": 0.40433,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        78,
        79
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9b9a28df1ad8e7cbdc6f7f0d94d89454f9e9b3190a836e7ea4c78eac14ed69c9",
        "724a3c144cdf79ac29a5d659ffe46b44c4d15fe6e9b1b81d31d512f8428f64ff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_ai_sha256": "19fd00e2783148d4a5693bf06e1d9ed1a2ce9f3099373e16deb195f721bf2711",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 78,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "谁都说，过了那一场，涤洲什么也不怕了。",
      "output_sha256": "124fbdcb1edcf46a48691e1f2bf2663a4af70d552a7562703b6c262f71c758e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 80,
      "source_human_sha256": "124fbdcb1edcf46a48691e1f2bf2663a4af70d552a7562703b6c262f71c758e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 79,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他竟会死了！",
      "output_sha256": "c5e8a35ed5ab09bd3fef2c6d50cad146c4da0a08bc6cc2de38864219370c3a9a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 81,
      "source_human_sha256": "c5e8a35ed5ab09bd3fef2c6d50cad146c4da0a08bc6cc2de38864219370c3a9a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 80,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他死的时候，一群朋友围着他，眼看着咽气，没办法。",
      "output_sha256": "846987675bde739ddc0e8348c78fef6c6527b3309e854cdb4b77173beed8f10a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 71,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 82,
      "source_human_sha256": "846987675bde739ddc0e8348c78fef6c6527b3309e854cdb4b77173beed8f10a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 81,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他曾给予朋友多少帮助，而如今大家只能眼睁睁看着他离去。",
      "output_sha256": "b8c99122270618bf2fe9e07767bf757a0705bf0584cde0326f26d35f5d4b5291",
      "alignment_unit_index": 72,
      "alignment_score": 0.523788,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        83
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aa3cff6f8c644a1370cde015289af34d8a399c1fee7913e5ae91c3d962bf219a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b8c99122270618bf2fe9e07767bf757a0705bf0584cde0326f26d35f5d4b5291",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        72
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 82,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他死后，由上海汉口青岛赶来许多朋友，来哭；有什么用呢？",
      "output_sha256": "ba8e096cb34ffab2c1619839af133c5d2c6c2db43d3da47a287ef4b7cf471bb9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 73,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 84,
      "source_human_sha256": "ba8e096cb34ffab2c1619839af133c5d2c6c2db43d3da47a287ef4b7cf471bb9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 83,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他已经死在医院了， 老太太还拉着大庄给他送果子来。",
      "output_sha256": "82a6349e326d8426e74bb312e4fe3b72c387353efd7df804a35a27c37abf00c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 74,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 85,
      "source_human_sha256": "82a6349e326d8426e74bb312e4fe3b72c387353efd7df804a35a27c37abf00c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 84,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "噢，这一切就不必再说了，悲惨到了什么地步呢！",
      "output_sha256": "03cabfa36b1dc1208e454b818ad1560484ebebd164579f0476bf407b5e293910",
      "alignment_unit_index": 75,
      "alignment_score": 0.519795,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        86
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "432f31d7d5ecfe450db5382e2c1990ee99356972eb454f3d39eb5cb166c8fc70"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 75,
      "source_ai_sha256": "03cabfa36b1dc1208e454b818ad1560484ebebd164579f0476bf407b5e293910",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        75
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 85,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "涤洲，涤洲，我们只有哭；没用，是没用。",
      "output_sha256": "9d25903594193d3c6f02b25ed52bd1626c325943ab65349399e537e2b5159f3d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 76,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 87,
      "source_human_sha256": "9d25903594193d3c6f02b25ed52bd1626c325943ab65349399e537e2b5159f3d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 86,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "可是，我们正是为了你的人生价值而哭泣。",
      "output_sha256": "18ff033eeccd222a8fc82ab8c211193a7344583f517e694b770e286f538054cd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 77,
      "alignment_score": 0.515126,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        88
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "60f0e6be975c3d20124c2019f67162fbe60dae8498a09d097b92c6bec4c9a42d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 77,
      "source_ai_sha256": "18ff033eeccd222a8fc82ab8c211193a7344583f517e694b770e286f538054cd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        77
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 87,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们可以找到比你更英俊的人、学识更渊博的人、思想更高深的人；但我们去哪里找一个像你这样的“朋友”呢？",
      "output_sha256": "e4b451799939248d13ec4c10ce9b814e0bb414e83f5e7d858a11ce7dfcc9c693",
      "alignment_unit_index": 78,
      "alignment_score": 0.516214,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        89
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e0d0ea3aa1aea574aa58031aed933681134f05a090a358d80effe295fef8d023"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 78,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e4b451799939248d13ec4c10ce9b814e0bb414e83f5e7d858a11ce7dfcc9c693",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        78
      ]
    }
  ]
}
